  "description": "Keyless registration under the open policy (a Config-only product, D-08). register() sends no credential, only the device id, a hashed fingerprint and the device label (PX-W13), and stores the token it gets back; it does not sync by itself. The next sync fetches the config document alone, and the gate reports not-applicable because the product runs no licence service.",
